# Not uploaded with a deployment: the guard suites (suites/README.md) and their run folder. vercel.json excludeFiles keeps
# them out of the functions as well (excludeFiles is the one that does not depend on this file); the private image fixtures
# are not in git at all.
/suites/

# The Vercel CLI reads this file INSTEAD OF .gitignore when it exists (not verified here: step V2 of the plan), so everything
# .gitignore keeps out of git is repeated here. A CLI upload must not start carrying node_modules, a local dist, .env files
# or the local .vercel folder because this file appeared.
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*
node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local
.vscode/*
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv
.vercel
.env*
